-- See https://wiki.hypr.land/Configuring/Advanced-and-Cool/Environment-variables/

-- XCURSOR_THEME has to be in the environment before a client starts, so it
-- cannot come from gsettings the way the GTK theme does. Named explicitly
-- rather than left at "default": that is a real theme directory carrying only
-- "Inherits=Adwaita", and XWayland and some toolkits do not follow the
-- indirection, which is how you end up with the X11 cross cursor over some
-- windows. ~/.local/bin/apply-gtk-theme keeps the GTK-side keys in step.
--
-- No HYPRCURSOR_THEME: no hyprcursor theme is installed (nothing ships a
-- manifest.hl), so Hyprland falls back to this XCursor theme. HYPRCURSOR_SIZE
-- stays so the fallback matches if one is ever added.
hl.env("XCURSOR_THEME", "Adwaita")
hl.env("XCURSOR_SIZE", "24")
hl.env("HYPRCURSOR_SIZE", "24")


